        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "05 - LLM Safety and Reliability Engineering",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Safety is not a single knob. It is a threat model with multiple attack surfaces\nand multiple overlapping defenses — the same defense-in-depth principle you apply\nto network security, applied to probabilistic text generators."
    },
