        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "05 - LLM Safety and Reliability Engineering",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nSTRIDE category              LLM threat equivalent\n──────────────────────────   ────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nTampering (input)         →  Direct prompt injection\n  (attacker modifies data      (user input overrides system prompt instructions;\n   in transit or at rest)       \"ignore previous instructions\" in user message)"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-SAFETY.md#008",
      "path": [
        "05-SAFETY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:ai-engineering:05-safety, git-history:ai-engineering:05-safety]",
        "canonical_path": "ai-engineering/05-SAFETY.md",
        "concepts": "[safety]",
        "current_path": "ai-engineering/05-SAFETY.md",
        "id": "maxim:ai-engineering:safety",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "ai-engineering",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[safety]",
        "section": "ai-engineering",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "05 - LLM Safety and Reliability Engineering",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Tampering (supply chain)  →  Indirect / data-poisoning injection\n  (compromised dependency        (malicious content in retrieved docs, web pages,\n   or third-party service)       DB records, email attachments — attacker controls\n                                 data the agent trusts as \"context\")"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-SAFETY.md#009",
      "path": [
        "05-SAFETY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
