        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "05 - LLM Safety and Reliability Engineering",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Information Disclosure    →  PII leakage / prompt leakage\n  (correct data, wrong           (model regurgitates RAG-indexed PII; system\n   recipient or channel)          prompt contents extracted via crafted queries)"
    },
